cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository accompanies a paper under review. Until it appears, please
  cite the published pipeline that this work audits, listed below.
title: "diabetes-xai-dependencygraph"
abstract: >-
  A guideline-sourced dependency graph for auditing counterfactual recourse in
  type-2 diabetes risk prediction. Recasts a flat per-feature intervention
  taxonomy as a directed graph in which direction is a node attribute and an
  intervention route is an edge, every edge sourced from a numbered ADA
  Standards of Care recommendation with its evidence grade. Audits a published
  counterfactual pipeline against that graph and measures the cost of excluding
  health-status indicators from the generator search space.
